 entity nobody knows much about. The emperor Xia Gaojun enters Ye Ming Palace where the Raven Consort resides. There he encounters Liu Shouxue, a beautiful young girl dressed all in black.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zdKyuE6KU96Mf87EGNoWbiBR7xr.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"The Raven Consort is a special consort who does not perform nighttime duties. Though she accepts all requests including death curses, exorcisms, and finding lost items, it is said that misfortune befalls those who meet her. Despite living in the inner palace, she is a mysterious entity nobody knows much about. The emperor Xia Gaojun enters Ye Ming Palace where the Raven Consort resides. There he encounters Liu Shouxue, a beautiful young girl dressed all in black.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zdKyuE6KU96Mf87EGNoWbiBR7xr.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17038","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142701","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50590","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153482","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413515","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"65688","synopsis":"At Gaojun's request, Shouxue investigates the ghost possessing the jade earring. The owner of the earring was Ban Yingnü. Ten years ago, she was suspected of poisoning the Third Consort and hanged herself. In order to discover the truth about her death, Shouxue heads to the wash house with her lady-in-waiting Jiu-Jiu where Ban Yingnü's personal attendant Su Hongqiao resides. However, Su Hongqiao is unable to speak to them as her tongue has been cut out.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y9m7x9JeEE5RY0pbPGLv7i1y1Qr.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"At Gaojun's request, Shouxue investigates the ghost possessing the jade earring. The owner of the earring was Ban Yingnü. Ten years ago, she was suspected of poisoning the Third Consort and hanged herself. In order to discover the truth about her death, Shouxue heads to the wash house with her lady-in-waiting Jiu-Jiu where Ban Yingnü's personal attendant Su Hongqiao resides. However, Su Hongqiao is unable to speak to them as her tongue has been cut out.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y9m7x9JeEE5RY0pbPGLv7i1y1Qr.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17038","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142701","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50590","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153482","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413515","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"65754","synopsis":"Huaniang, the high-ranking inner palace consort who lives at Yuanqian Palace, comes to Ye Ming Palace. She wants to know why her flower whistle will not blow. Flower whistles are hung from the eaves of buildings at the end of winter to mourn those who passed away the previous year. Allegedly the dead return on winds announcing the coming of spring to blow the whistles. Huaniang is concerned that her whistle has not blown since she lost her lover Ou Xuanyou. Shouxue complies with her request and attempts to summon the soul of Ou Xuanyou so she can speak to him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xF4CIg0GN4iRTawRmyriJ04MCgy.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Huaniang, the high-ranking inner palace consort who lives at Yuanqian Palace, comes to Ye Ming Palace. She wants to know why her flower whistle will not blow. Flower whistles are hung from the eaves of buildings at the end of winter to mourn those who passed away the previous year. Allegedly the dead return on winds announcing the coming of spring to blow the whistles. Huaniang is concerned that her whistle has not blown since she lost her lover Ou Xuanyou. Shouxue complies with her request and attempts to summon the soul of Ou Xuanyou so she can speak to him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xF4CIg0GN4iRTawRmyriJ04MCgy.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17038","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142701","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50590","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153482","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413515","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"65846","synopsis":"The ghost of a skylark visits Shouxue, which leads to her hearing the tale of the Skylark Princess and her tragic death.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eDViaVvPBhl5CiSfiuKqa1c1aS2.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"The ghost of a skylark visits Shouxue, which leads to her hearing the tale of the Skylark Princess and her tragic death.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eDViaVvPBhl5CiSfiuKqa1c1aS2.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17038","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142701","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50590","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153482","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413515","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"65949","synopsis":"Two ghosts from